==Description==
The '''Frozen''' was an ice elemental enemy. It was the first enemy to spawn in [[Village of Despair]] as part of the [[Christmas 2019 Event]]. 

It had 60 health and walked at an average speed. It was also immune to being frozen by the [[Freezer]] and [[Frost Blaster]].

The '''Frozen''' could have also been spawned by [[Krampus (Village of Despair)|Krampus]].

==Appearance==
The '''Frozen''' had sky blue skin, and marble light blue torso and legs. Its head was unique as it was not round, with some part sticking out of the head. It was also faceless.

==Strategy==
*A couple of [[Mortar]]s, [[Rocketeer]]s or [[Archer|Holiday Archers]] can be used to take out the first few waves of '''Frozens''' while money accumulates.
*The '''Frozen''' is completely immune to the [[Freezer]] and [[Frost Blaster]], including the [[Freezer]]'s ''Ice Age'' ability.
**If you want to slow it down, you can use the [[Pyromancer]].

